<title>USA: USX Corp to sell RMI Titanium stake.</title>
<headline>USX Corp to sell RMI Titanium stake.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ohio 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMI Titanium Co said Thursday that USX Corp, its largest shareholder, has advised its intention to offer to the public its notes exchangeable for up to 5,483,600 shares of RMI Common Stock.</p>
<p>Such shares represent all of the RMI Common Stock owned by USX and 27 percent of RMI's outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
